    {
      "id": "bayes",
      "prompt": "一种病患病率2%，试剂敏感度80%，未患病者误报率10%。随机一人阳性，他患病概率多少？请把假阳性计入并推导。",
      "runId": "18d792e8-7c96-421b-9023-efc17c48067c",
      "run": {
        "status": "succeeded",
        "errorCode": null,
        "route": {
          "version": 1,
          "workload": "adaptive",
          "entryMode": "direct_fast",
          "resourceDecision": {
            "path": "work",
            "source": "fallback",
            "version": 1,
            "policyHash": "4bf3db017611ffa133c4b91da6e7ff5eaa39aaad9dbf0c862586c6541a3fa167"
          }
        },
        "stepCount": 4,
        "modelCallCount": 6
      },
      "checks": {
        "succeeded": true,
        "nonempty": true,
        "noInternalLeak": true
      },
      "ok": true,
      "elapsedMs": 119667,
      "firstVisibleMs": 118259,
      "calls": [
        {
          "name": "observe.calculate",
          "status": "succeeded",
          "riskClass": "read"
        }
      ],
      "messages": [
        [
          {
            "text": "先按贝叶斯公式推导。记 D 为患病，+ 为阳性：\n\n- P(D) = 0.02（患病率），P(¬D) = 0.98\n- P(+|D) = 0.80（敏感度）\n- P(+|¬D) = 0.10（误报率）\n\n由全概率公式：\n\n**P(+) = P(+|D)·P(D) + P(+|¬D)·P(¬D) = 0.8×0.02 + 0.1×0.98 = 0.016 + 0.098 = 0.114**\n\n代入贝叶斯公式：\n\n**P(D|+) = P(+|D)·P(D) / P(+) = 0.016 / 0.114 ≈ 0.1404**\n\n所以随机一人阳性，他实际患病的概率约为 **14%**。\n\n直观理解：每 1000 人里约有 20 个病人，其中 16 人会阳性；980 个健康人里有 98 人被误报阳性。阳性总共 114 人，真病人只占 16 份——假阳性比真阳性多了 6 倍多，把答案从 80% 拖到 14%。病率越低，这个稀释效应越明显。",
            "type": "text",
            "emotion": "neutral"
          }
        ]
      ],
